# Routing

- Annotate screens `@RoutePage()`. Register in `AppRouter` (`replaceInRouteName: 'Screen|Page,Route'`). Default `RouteType.material()`. FadeUpwards transitions live on `AppTheme`, not the router.
- Current routes (do not add extras unless asked):

| Screen | Path | Initial |
|---|---|---|
| `LoginScreen` | `/` | yes |
| `CatalogScreen` | `/catalog` | |
| `CheckoutScreen` | `/checkout` | |
| `OrderSummaryScreen` | `/order-summary` | |

- After changing routes, run build_runner. Import generated `app_router.gr.dart` (`LoginRoute`, `CatalogRoute`, …).
- Login `listenWhen` status → success: `context.router.push(const CatalogRoute())`.
- Order Summary Done: `AuthEvent.signOut()`, then `listenWhen` success: `context.router.push(const LoginRoute())` (push, not `replaceAll`).
- Catalog Checkout: `push(const CheckoutRoute())` with no arguments. Checkout Complete: `push(const OrderSummaryRoute())`.
